WEBVTT

00:00:30.580 --> 00:00:32.300
I'm off.

00:00:32.950 --> 00:00:34.380
Have a good day.

00:00:38.270 --> 00:00:39.600
I'll be going now.

00:00:39.600 --> 00:00:41.440
Please take care.

00:00:53.580 --> 00:00:54.740
I'm off.

00:01:00.920 --> 00:01:05.540
It's across this bridge, right?

00:01:10.360 --> 00:01:13.230
<i>I didn't care where I went to high school.</i>

00:01:14.070 --> 00:01:18.340
<i>Nothing could change the fate 
that separated me from him.</i>

00:01:20.380 --> 00:01:22.390
I'll go see him once school is out.

00:01:39.150 --> 00:01:40.200
A dog?

00:01:40.590 --> 00:01:42.870
But where is it?

00:01:47.090 --> 00:01:49.810
There!

00:01:50.310 --> 00:01:52.000
And there's a girl, too!

00:01:52.540 --> 00:01:53.750
H-Hey!

00:01:53.750 --> 00:01:55.630
What happened to you? Are you okay?

00:01:57.790 --> 00:02:01.250
Yeah. Aside from being 
bitten by this doggy and

00:02:01.250 --> 00:02:05.640
the pain from my hair getting 
caught, I'm totally fine.

00:02:05.640 --> 00:02:06.980
You're not fine at all!

00:02:07.270 --> 00:02:08.140
I should get help...

00:02:11.760 --> 00:02:12.980
Aw, jeez!

00:02:12.980 --> 00:02:13.900
Listen!

00:02:13.900 --> 00:02:16.240
Hold still! Don't move a muscle!

00:02:29.500 --> 00:02:32.370
<i>This is lousy luck to be having 
on the first day of school.</i>

00:02:32.370 --> 00:02:33.290
Excuse me!

00:02:33.630 --> 00:02:36.670
Are you a first-year student 
at Tennomifune Academy?

00:02:36.900 --> 00:02:38.270
Y-Yeah...

00:02:38.750 --> 00:02:41.100
No, wait. Don't talk!

00:02:41.100 --> 00:02:42.260
You'll fall!

00:02:42.260 --> 00:02:44.640
Wow, so am I!

00:02:47.780 --> 00:02:49.350
What's your name?

00:02:49.710 --> 00:02:50.700
Ruri...

00:02:50.700 --> 00:02:52.730
Hibarigaoka Ruri.

00:02:53.980 --> 00:02:54.940
Hibari-chan!

00:02:56.280 --> 00:02:58.780
Make sure you catch him.

00:02:58.780 --> 00:02:59.920
Huh?!

00:03:14.560 --> 00:03:16.380
Wh-Where is she?

00:03:16.380 --> 00:03:17.590
Don't tell me...

00:03:21.990 --> 00:03:24.780
Are you sure you're okay? Are you injured?

00:03:24.780 --> 00:03:26.470
Nope, I'm fine.

00:03:26.470 --> 00:03:29.410
I fell in the deep part of the river, 
so I didn't hit anything.

00:03:29.410 --> 00:03:30.180
I see...

00:03:31.360 --> 00:03:32.690
I'm so glad he's all right.

00:03:36.150 --> 00:03:38.060
<b>Rrrumble</b>

00:03:38.860 --> 00:03:41.080
Maybe he was in a bad mood.

00:03:41.080 --> 00:03:42.980
Farewell.

00:03:49.880 --> 00:03:51.900
How did that happen?

00:03:51.900 --> 00:03:55.840
I ran into the doggy as he was 
about to fall off the bridge.

00:03:55.840 --> 00:03:59.340
Thanks, though. You saved me, Hibari-chan.

00:03:59.730 --> 00:04:01.670
The only one who was saved was the dog.

00:04:01.990 --> 00:04:04.560
You had terrible luck, huh?

00:04:05.780 --> 00:04:06.600
No.

00:04:09.310 --> 00:04:12.300
I'm really lucky!

00:04:21.380 --> 00:04:22.510
Is that the school bell?

00:04:22.510 --> 00:04:25.620
Oh, no! Hibari-chan, we'd better hurry!

00:04:25.620 --> 00:04:26.750
Hey, wait!

00:04:26.750 --> 00:04:28.890
I left my shoes on the bridge!

00:04:28.890 --> 00:04:30.780
Come on! Hurry, hurry!

00:04:29.800 --> 00:04:31.620
I said, wait!

00:06:03.630 --> 00:06:06.300
Here at Tennomifune Academy,

00:06:06.300 --> 00:06:14.600
we strive to help our students develop 
their academic and athletic talents.

00:06:15.220 --> 00:06:17.850
<i>I was nearly late to my first day of school...</i>

00:06:15.220 --> 00:06:20.900
By the way, my favorite expression is 
"fall seven times, get up eight."

00:06:18.270 --> 00:06:20.650
I'm glad we made it on time, Hibari-chan.

00:06:20.650 --> 00:06:22.310
Y-Yeah...

00:06:20.900 --> 00:06:23.480
Looking back, my life has had its ups and downs.

00:06:22.980 --> 00:06:27.280
<i>I can't believe we're in the same class, 
even with seven classes per grade.</i>

00:06:23.480 --> 00:06:26.610
I was born the successor of a dry goods dealer,

00:06:26.610 --> 00:06:29.200
but for various reasons, my family scattered.

00:06:29.490 --> 00:06:31.990
Not only was I late on such an important day,

00:06:29.490 --> 00:06:32.070
I left my home, as well...

00:06:31.990 --> 00:06:34.910
but I caused trouble for the teachers, too...

00:06:35.240 --> 00:06:37.710
Are you okay, Kumegawa-san?

00:06:37.710 --> 00:06:41.460
<b>Fortune</b>

00:06:37.710 --> 00:06:41.460
<b>Anne-Happy</b>

00:06:37.710 --> 00:06:41.460
<b>Episode 1</b>

00:06:37.710 --> 00:06:41.460
<b>Terrible
Luck</b>

00:06:37.710 --> 00:06:41.460
<b>April 7
An Unfortunate
First Day of School</b>

00:06:44.170 --> 00:06:47.670
Come to think of it, 
you haven't told me your name yet.

00:06:47.670 --> 00:06:49.170
Oh, right!

00:06:49.380 --> 00:06:50.380
Ahem.

00:06:51.140 --> 00:06:53.850
I'm Hanakoizumi Anne.

00:06:53.390 --> 00:06:58.730
<b>Hanakoizumi
Anne</b>

00:06:53.850 --> 00:06:57.850
Most people called me Anne in middle school.

00:06:57.850 --> 00:06:58.730
Nice to meet you.

00:07:00.140 --> 00:07:01.940
Nice to meet you, Hanako.

00:07:01.940 --> 00:07:02.980
Huh?

00:07:03.900 --> 00:07:06.190
Hanako?

00:07:03.900 --> 00:07:06.610
<b>Ha</b>

00:07:04.650 --> 00:07:06.610
<b>na</b>

00:07:05.400 --> 00:07:06.610
<b>ko</b>

00:07:06.900 --> 00:07:10.320
If I'm Hibari, then shouldn't you be Hanako?

00:07:06.940 --> 00:07:10.320
<b>Hibarigaoka
Ruri</b>

00:07:10.320 --> 00:07:11.700
<b>ko</b>

00:07:10.320 --> 00:07:11.950
<b>na</b>

00:07:10.320 --> 00:07:12.160
<b>Ha</b>

00:07:10.780 --> 00:07:13.950
Hanakoizumi Anne...

00:07:12.160 --> 00:07:12.530
<b>Ha na ko i</b>

00:07:12.530 --> 00:07:12.950
<b>Ha na ko i zu</b>

00:07:12.950 --> 00:07:13.530
<b>Ha na ko i zu mi</b>

00:07:13.530 --> 00:07:14.330
<b>Ha na ko i zu mi Anne</b>

00:07:14.330 --> 00:07:14.830
<b>Ha</b>

00:07:14.330 --> 00:07:14.830
<b>na ko i zu mi Anne</b>

00:07:14.370 --> 00:07:15.950
Hanako...

00:07:14.830 --> 00:07:15.330
<b>Ha na</b>

00:07:14.830 --> 00:07:15.330
<b>ko i zu mi Anne</b>

00:07:15.330 --> 00:07:17.540
<b>Ha na ko</b>

00:07:15.330 --> 00:07:17.540
<b>i zu mi Anne</b>

00:07:16.410 --> 00:07:17.540
Hanako!

00:07:17.870 --> 00:07:19.750
<i>Maybe that was too mean.</i>

00:07:19.750 --> 00:07:21.710
Hanako's cute!

00:07:21.710 --> 00:07:23.670
Thanks, Hibari-chan!

00:07:25.710 --> 00:07:28.300
I'm so glad we're in the same class.

00:07:28.300 --> 00:07:29.170
Right?

00:07:30.170 --> 00:07:31.380
Yeah.

00:07:31.380 --> 00:07:40.350
<b>April 7</b>

00:07:31.680 --> 00:07:36.560
I wasn't expecting to get 
into a school this good.

00:07:36.560 --> 00:07:39.480
I only applied because it was 
the closest one to home.

00:07:39.480 --> 00:07:41.520
I surprised all kinds of people.

00:07:41.520 --> 00:07:43.230
Me, too.

00:07:43.230 --> 00:07:46.150
I don't think I'm particularly 
talented at anything,

00:07:46.150 --> 00:07:47.820
so I don't know how I got in.

00:07:48.940 --> 00:07:50.530
We were both lucky.

00:07:50.530 --> 00:07:52.360
Okay, then...

00:07:52.700 --> 00:07:54.660
Is there anything you like?

00:07:54.660 --> 00:07:55.320
Huh?

00:07:56.580 --> 00:07:58.660
Why would you ask that?

00:07:58.660 --> 00:08:02.370
Maybe your interests were 
part of why you got accepted.

00:08:02.370 --> 00:08:04.080
Oh, my interests...

00:08:04.540 --> 00:08:06.590
I guess I like cooking.

00:08:06.590 --> 00:08:07.840
Wh-What about you?

00:08:07.840 --> 00:08:10.920
I love animals!

00:08:10.920 --> 00:08:15.840
I don't know why, but all kinds 
of animals come up to me.

00:08:15.840 --> 00:08:18.220
Like the doggy we saved earlier.

00:08:18.220 --> 00:08:20.180
That dog was just biting you!

00:08:23.350 --> 00:08:25.100
Oh, sorry.

00:08:25.100 --> 00:08:28.320
Your conversation was just so 
funny, I couldn't help myself.

00:08:29.480 --> 00:08:31.150
Oh, um...

00:08:31.530 --> 00:08:34.150
Not only did someone eavesdrop 
on your conversation,

00:08:32.070 --> 00:08:42.750
<b>Gloom Gloom Gloom</b>

00:08:34.150 --> 00:08:37.830
but now an unfamiliar and creepy 
girl is laughing at you, as well.

00:08:37.830 --> 00:08:40.330
You must be quite upset.

00:08:40.330 --> 00:08:42.750
No, I wasn't thinking that, exactly...

00:08:42.750 --> 00:08:47.540
Oh, my! Then you won't report 
me to the authorities?

00:08:47.540 --> 00:08:51.340
I knew you were pretty, but I 
had no idea you were an angel!

00:08:51.340 --> 00:08:53.050
Uh, okay...

00:08:53.300 --> 00:08:56.090
My name is Kumegawa Botan.

00:08:55.090 --> 00:09:02.270
<b>Kumegawa 
Botan</b>

00:08:56.090 --> 00:08:59.140
Though I'm much more of a worthless 
weakling than my name suggests,

00:08:59.140 --> 00:09:02.270
I hope we can still be friends, Hibari-san.

00:09:02.270 --> 00:09:04.230
I-It's nice to meet you.

00:09:04.230 --> 00:09:07.020
Botan-chan, you have such a cute name.

00:09:07.020 --> 00:09:07.810
I'm—

00:09:07.810 --> 00:09:09.730
Hanako-san, right?

00:09:10.900 --> 00:09:12.650
Yeah! Nice to meet you!

00:09:19.280 --> 00:09:22.120
Please don't let it bother you.

00:09:22.120 --> 00:09:26.500
I'm sure my finger bone just cracked a little.

00:09:26.500 --> 00:09:29.500
It's not a big deal.

00:09:29.500 --> 00:09:30.840
It sounds like a big deal!

00:09:31.840 --> 00:09:34.170
I-I'm sorry! I heard it crack...

00:09:34.170 --> 00:09:36.430
It's not your fault, Hanako-san.

00:09:36.430 --> 00:09:38.180
Don't worry about it.

00:09:38.180 --> 00:09:39.350
B-But...

00:09:39.760 --> 00:09:42.060
I'll administer first aid.

00:09:46.810 --> 00:09:50.020
That's amazing! I get hurt all the time, too.

00:09:51.320 --> 00:09:53.150
When you put on a bandage,

00:09:51.940 --> 00:09:55.190
<i>Why? Why is everyone so weird?</i>

00:09:53.150 --> 00:09:56.570
wrapping from the tip inward 
to the middle helps it stay on.

00:09:55.190 --> 00:09:57.280
<i>What's up with this class?</i>

00:09:56.570 --> 00:09:57.280
Really?

00:09:58.410 --> 00:10:01.240
Is everyone here?

00:10:01.240 --> 00:10:03.410
I hung up my clothes to dry!

00:10:01.240 --> 00:10:04.200
Well Done

00:10:04.200 --> 00:10:07.290
I'm your homeroom teacher, Ms. Kodaira.

00:10:07.710 --> 00:10:10.130
As you heard at the entrance ceremony,

00:10:10.130 --> 00:10:13.550
this academy develops its students' talents

00:10:13.550 --> 00:10:15.670
and produces many great individuals.

00:10:16.220 --> 00:10:18.590
Classes 1 through 3 will focus on academics.

00:10:18.590 --> 00:10:21.640
Classes 4 through 6 will focus on specializing

00:10:21.640 --> 00:10:24.890
in sports over the next three years.

00:10:24.890 --> 00:10:26.600
Huh?

00:10:26.600 --> 00:10:29.650
Ma'am, no one told us before the 
entrance exam that our studies

00:10:29.650 --> 00:10:31.150
would be split like that.

00:10:31.150 --> 00:10:34.320
Ah, you're Hibarigaoka Ruri-san, aren't you?

00:10:34.320 --> 00:10:35.280
Yes.

00:10:35.280 --> 00:10:38.200
And this is Class 7.

00:10:38.200 --> 00:10:40.110
What do we do?

00:10:40.110 --> 00:10:42.450
That's a very good question.

00:10:42.450 --> 00:10:44.160
All of you...

00:10:51.580 --> 00:10:55.050
<b>Happiness</b>

00:10:52.330 --> 00:10:55.050
will become "happy."

00:10:57.670 --> 00:10:58.800
Happy?

00:10:59.170 --> 00:11:01.430
I'm not surprised that you're perplexed.

00:11:01.430 --> 00:11:06.060
But you'll have plenty of time to 
understand, so let me be direct.

00:11:07.020 --> 00:11:10.600
Everyone here is unfortunate.

00:11:12.100 --> 00:11:16.730
While many people are born 
lucky, others are not.

00:11:16.730 --> 00:11:20.820
Some people are unable to develop their 
talents because of their misfortune.

00:11:20.820 --> 00:11:25.530
And you're all unfortunate, to some degree.

00:11:25.910 --> 00:11:27.950
We're unfortunate?

00:11:30.250 --> 00:11:34.590
Thanks, but I'm not as unfortunate 
a person as you say I am.

00:11:34.590 --> 00:11:37.170
Before the entrance exam, 
this school conducts

00:11:37.170 --> 00:11:39.130
a top-secret investigation.

00:11:39.550 --> 00:11:43.590
Are you claiming that you really 
have no idea what I mean?

00:11:46.180 --> 00:11:47.720
Don't worry.

00:11:48.180 --> 00:11:50.850
We've gathered you all in one class

00:11:50.850 --> 00:11:55.440
so you can overcome your 
misfortune and become happy.

00:11:55.440 --> 00:12:03.700
<b>Chatter Chatter</b>

00:11:55.810 --> 00:12:00.320
Each day we'll be measuring 
your level of misfortune

00:12:00.320 --> 00:12:03.700
and training you to become happy.

00:12:03.990 --> 00:12:06.530
<i>What? What is this?</i>

00:12:07.200 --> 00:12:09.450
We all get to be happy!

00:12:09.450 --> 00:12:10.870
How wonderful!

00:12:11.210 --> 00:12:14.080
<i>I thought I'd have three normal years...</i>

00:12:14.080 --> 00:12:16.840
I do get lost sometimes.

00:12:16.840 --> 00:12:19.050
You call three times in one day "sometimes"?

00:12:19.630 --> 00:12:23.010
<i>...of an ordinary high school life.</i>

00:12:24.510 --> 00:12:27.300
Shut up already, you brats.

00:12:27.300 --> 00:12:30.140
This is why you have such terrible luck.

00:12:32.850 --> 00:12:35.440
Okay! Good girls!

00:12:35.440 --> 00:12:40.070
Now, let's change seats before 
we start today's measurement.

00:12:40.730 --> 00:12:41.940
<i>Yikes!</i>

00:12:43.110 --> 00:12:47.280
This morning, I put pieces of paper with 
numbers written on them in your desks.

00:12:47.570 --> 00:12:51.000
We'll be using them to determine your seats.

00:12:51.000 --> 00:12:56.000
I suppose you could say the smaller 
your number, the luckier you are.

00:12:57.920 --> 00:13:00.420
<i>There's no way you can measure 
someone's luck with this.</i>

00:13:03.970 --> 00:13:07.850
<i>28 out of 40... I don't know how to feel.</i>

00:13:09.140 --> 00:13:10.510
<i>What am I thinking?</i>

00:13:10.510 --> 00:13:12.310
<i>It's just a question of probability!</i>

00:13:13.230 --> 00:13:14.940
Hey, Hibari-chan.

00:13:14.940 --> 00:13:16.270
Wh-What?

00:13:16.270 --> 00:13:19.570
This class has 40 people in it, right?

00:13:19.570 --> 00:13:20.320
Yeah.

00:13:21.320 --> 00:13:25.900
<b>Death</b>

00:13:22.070 --> 00:13:25.900
<b>Suffering</b>

00:13:23.940 --> 00:13:29.780
H-Hanako-san, perhaps the ink 
just smudged to make it a nine.

00:13:29.780 --> 00:13:31.870
Oh, I see!

00:13:31.870 --> 00:13:34.500
<i>There was this morning, too. This girl...</i>

00:13:31.870 --> 00:13:34.790
So that means you're number 40.

00:13:34.790 --> 00:13:35.620
Botan-chan...

00:13:35.830 --> 00:13:38.330
Okay, all your seats have been assigned.

00:13:38.670 --> 00:13:43.670
That's all for today, but I'd like to try 
giving you a homework assignment.

00:13:45.130 --> 00:13:46.840
(Warning: Past Expiration Date)

00:13:47.840 --> 00:13:48.680
Eggs?

00:13:48.680 --> 00:13:50.350
These are eggs.

00:13:50.350 --> 00:13:52.390
They're raw, so be careful.

00:13:52.770 --> 00:13:56.140
I want you to keep your eggs until 
tomorrow, without breaking them.

00:13:56.140 --> 00:13:58.190
This is today's homework assignment.

00:13:58.190 --> 00:14:00.940
You, there. Make sure you take yours home.

00:14:03.900 --> 00:14:05.490
<i>What is this?</i>

00:14:15.120 --> 00:14:17.040
That went by quick.

00:14:17.040 --> 00:14:19.040
I still can't accept the situation.

00:14:19.380 --> 00:14:22.040
Botan-chan, is your hand okay?

00:14:22.040 --> 00:14:24.590
Yes, this happens all the time.

00:14:24.590 --> 00:14:26.720
What about you? Are you all right?

00:14:26.720 --> 00:14:27.380
Yeah.

00:14:27.380 --> 00:14:30.340
I had Hibari-chan wrap it for me.

00:14:30.340 --> 00:14:31.600
I see.

00:14:31.600 --> 00:14:35.600
But it's amazing that you can treat yourself.

00:14:35.600 --> 00:14:37.810
I'm a doctor's daughter.

00:14:37.810 --> 00:14:42.650
But actually, I'm a useless girl 
who can only treat herself.

00:14:42.650 --> 00:14:45.280
Call me the One Woman Ward.

00:14:44.980 --> 00:14:46.530
<b>Heh heh heh</b>

00:14:47.030 --> 00:14:49.490
This will sting a bit.

00:14:49.860 --> 00:14:51.990
Botan-chan, which way is your house?

00:14:51.990 --> 00:14:53.280
That way.

00:14:53.280 --> 00:14:54.990
Wow! Me, too!

00:14:54.990 --> 00:14:56.000
What about you, Hibari-chan?

00:14:56.000 --> 00:14:57.370
The same.

00:14:57.370 --> 00:14:59.920
Then we can walk home together!

00:14:59.920 --> 00:15:01.630
Let's go!

00:15:00.250 --> 00:15:02.250
<b>Produce Stand</b>

00:15:02.250 --> 00:15:04.670
How many crows will I meet today?

00:15:04.670 --> 00:15:05.960
Crows?

00:15:05.960 --> 00:15:08.420
Yeah, I even named them.

00:15:07.210 --> 00:15:08.420
Sorry.

00:15:09.550 --> 00:15:11.720
I forgot that I needed to stop by somewhere.

00:15:11.720 --> 00:15:13.970
Oh, really?

00:15:13.970 --> 00:15:16.560
That's too bad, but I guess it can't be helped.

00:15:16.560 --> 00:15:18.810
Sorry. See you tomorrow.

00:15:18.810 --> 00:15:21.060
It's okay. Bye!

00:15:21.060 --> 00:15:23.020
Take care.

00:15:28.440 --> 00:15:29.490
How wonderful.

00:15:30.610 --> 00:15:33.570
I wanted to talk about our eggs...

00:15:33.570 --> 00:15:36.240
She must've had something 
very important to do.

00:15:36.240 --> 00:15:37.410
Yeah.

00:15:42.830 --> 00:15:44.540
It's pretty.

00:15:44.540 --> 00:15:45.920
It sure is.

00:15:48.010 --> 00:15:49.550
A kitty!

00:15:51.090 --> 00:15:52.180
Here, kitty!

00:15:59.270 --> 00:16:00.390
Hanako-san!

00:16:00.680 --> 00:16:02.310
I'm fine.

00:16:05.770 --> 00:16:07.570
Wait, kitty!

00:16:07.570 --> 00:16:08.780
It's over there!

00:16:08.780 --> 00:16:13.950
<b>Ratatatat</b>

00:16:18.160 --> 00:16:19.500
Where are you, kitty?

00:16:19.500 --> 00:16:21.160
Hanako-san!

00:16:25.630 --> 00:16:26.590
Kitty!

00:16:36.260 --> 00:16:39.100
Hanako-san... Hanako-san...

00:16:39.100 --> 00:16:42.480
I'll... help you...

00:16:42.730 --> 00:16:44.100
You're okay now.

00:16:56.570 --> 00:16:58.530
Eh? Huh?

00:16:59.240 --> 00:16:59.950
What?

00:17:01.000 --> 00:17:02.500
Huh? What?

00:17:02.910 --> 00:17:04.790
Huh? Huh?

00:17:05.170 --> 00:17:06.210
Huh?

00:17:06.630 --> 00:17:08.290
Huh? What?

00:17:08.840 --> 00:17:09.880
Ah... What?

00:17:11.170 --> 00:17:12.210
Is that good?

00:17:18.930 --> 00:17:22.850
<i>I don't have nearly enough time, 
now that my school is so far away.</i>

00:17:25.230 --> 00:17:28.110
<i>Overcoming misfortune so I can be happy?</i>

00:17:28.110 --> 00:17:29.110
<i>Assignment?</i>

00:17:29.110 --> 00:17:30.570
<i>Ridiculous.</i>

00:17:30.570 --> 00:17:33.610
<i>This is supposed to turn my fortune around?</i>

00:17:33.940 --> 00:17:37.030
<i>I'm not even unfortunate in the first place.</i>

00:17:42.040 --> 00:17:44.660
Hibari-chan.

00:17:45.540 --> 00:17:48.040
Hibari-chan.

00:17:48.540 --> 00:17:49.460
Wha...

00:17:49.040 --> 00:17:50.590
Hibari-chan.

00:17:50.590 --> 00:17:52.760
Hibari-san.

00:17:51.960 --> 00:17:54.210
Hibari-chan.

00:17:53.130 --> 00:17:54.970
Wh-Wh-What?

00:17:53.710 --> 00:17:55.590
Hibari-san.

00:17:54.970 --> 00:17:56.970
I-Is it... gho—

00:17:59.300 --> 00:18:01.060
Hibari-san...

00:18:03.520 --> 00:18:05.180
Huh? Botan?

00:18:05.180 --> 00:18:06.770
Hibari-chan!

00:18:07.100 --> 00:18:08.600
H-Hanako?

00:18:08.600 --> 00:18:11.320
It is you, Hibari-chan!

00:18:11.860 --> 00:18:13.070
The great escape!

00:18:15.690 --> 00:18:18.030
You really saved us.

00:18:18.320 --> 00:18:22.530
I was prepared to spend the 
night here with Botan-chan.

00:18:22.530 --> 00:18:23.540
Hanako...

00:18:23.990 --> 00:18:26.120
It's great that you want to save animals,

00:18:26.120 --> 00:18:30.130
but you should consider the 
consequences before you act.

00:18:30.130 --> 00:18:35.960
Yeah. But everyone was saved, 
and all's well that ends well.

00:18:35.960 --> 00:18:38.010
I really am lucky.

00:18:38.010 --> 00:18:40.340
I don't think that's true.

00:18:40.340 --> 00:18:41.800
Yes, it is!

00:18:41.800 --> 00:18:45.850
This morning, and just now, 
I was lucky that you happened by.

00:18:45.850 --> 00:18:48.350
And I'm lucky to be in the same class as you.

00:18:48.810 --> 00:18:50.560
Thank you so much!

00:18:50.810 --> 00:18:52.520
I-It was nothing.

00:18:52.520 --> 00:18:56.530
Anyone would've saved you if they'd come 
across that situation, not just me.

00:19:04.240 --> 00:19:05.740
Sorry, Hibari-chan!

00:19:05.740 --> 00:19:06.950
Huh? What's wrong?

00:19:07.330 --> 00:19:10.420
I got mud on the handkerchief 
I borrowed from you.

00:19:11.210 --> 00:19:13.920
I was being really careful not to get it dirty...

00:19:14.670 --> 00:19:16.510
<i>So it wouldn't get dirty?</i>

00:19:20.260 --> 00:19:21.590
You dummy.

00:19:21.590 --> 00:19:23.970
There's already blood inside it, anyway.

00:19:23.970 --> 00:19:26.640
Oh, yeah... You're right.

00:19:26.640 --> 00:19:29.810
I'm sorry. It's such a pretty handkerchief, too.

00:19:29.810 --> 00:19:32.350
I'll give it back three times whiter than it was!

00:19:34.570 --> 00:19:37.900
Forget about it. It's just a handkerchief.

00:19:43.070 --> 00:19:44.030
Hibari-chan!

00:19:44.700 --> 00:19:47.490
You're really cute when you smile, too!

00:19:47.490 --> 00:19:49.750
Huh?! You idiot! What are you talking about?

00:19:49.750 --> 00:19:52.580
You're not only considerate, but cute, too.

00:19:50.540 --> 00:19:52.580
Let me see you smile again!

00:19:52.580 --> 00:19:54.540
You're nothing like my worthless self,

00:19:54.540 --> 00:19:57.710
who can't even help a cat 
and already broke her egg.

00:20:03.220 --> 00:20:05.890
O-Oh, right. Your eggs...

00:20:09.180 --> 00:20:10.730
Didn't they break when you...

00:20:10.730 --> 00:20:13.270
Hibari-chan, you dropped...

00:20:18.780 --> 00:20:21.650
<i>They found out already.</i>

00:20:24.110 --> 00:20:25.280
<i>This time...</i>

00:20:26.780 --> 00:20:30.790
<i>This time, I meant to keep it hidden.</i>

00:20:33.210 --> 00:20:36.290
Hibari-san, who's this person in the photo?

00:20:38.090 --> 00:20:40.420
It's someone important to me.

00:20:41.420 --> 00:20:46.850
I've walked to construction sites 
alone just so I could see him.

00:20:47.300 --> 00:20:52.350
I was mocked and teased for 
doing that until middle school.

00:20:52.350 --> 00:20:53.560
Huh?

00:20:53.980 --> 00:20:56.440
Why would they tease you?

00:20:56.440 --> 00:21:00.150
How romantic, to keep his 
photo in your pass case.

00:21:00.150 --> 00:21:01.110
Huh?

00:21:02.070 --> 00:21:03.860
I-It's not like that.

00:21:03.860 --> 00:21:06.030
When you think about it, it's weird, isn't it?

00:21:06.030 --> 00:21:07.740
After all, he's...

00:21:07.740 --> 00:21:10.950
<b>We apologize for the inconvenience.</b>

00:21:08.240 --> 00:21:10.950
just a sign at a construction site!

00:21:10.950 --> 00:21:14.670
As soon as people find out, 
they always tell everyone.

00:21:18.000 --> 00:21:21.800
I wouldn't tell anyone who my friend likes.

00:21:21.800 --> 00:21:22.880
Indeed.

00:21:26.340 --> 00:21:27.890
You wouldn't?

00:21:27.890 --> 00:21:29.100
No.

00:21:29.100 --> 00:21:30.430
No.

00:21:32.980 --> 00:21:34.270
I see.

00:21:38.690 --> 00:21:40.150
I'm going home.

00:21:40.150 --> 00:21:41.730
Yes, let's.

00:21:41.730 --> 00:21:43.530
Let's go home!

00:21:51.660 --> 00:21:54.750
It looks like you've all broken your eggs.

00:21:54.750 --> 00:22:01.590
<b>Assignment</b>

00:21:55.210 --> 00:21:56.920
I expected this.

00:21:56.920 --> 00:22:00.460
Write down what happened that caused
you to break your egg, and turn it in.

00:22:00.460 --> 00:22:01.590
Ma'am!

00:22:01.590 --> 00:22:03.300
Ta-da!

00:22:05.050 --> 00:22:05.760
Oh, my.

00:22:06.340 --> 00:22:08.010
Yours didn't break?

00:22:08.010 --> 00:22:09.470
That's amazing.

00:22:10.510 --> 00:22:12.640
I slept with it all night long.

00:22:13.680 --> 00:22:14.680
Huh?

00:22:19.150 --> 00:22:20.480
You're kidding, right?

00:22:21.650 --> 00:22:22.860
How cute!

00:22:24.740 --> 00:22:26.650
You like sitting on my forehead?

00:22:25.070 --> 00:22:29.780
<i>This girl might be the most unfortunate of all.</i>

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:39.980
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:39.980
<b>April 11</b>

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:39.980
<b>"The High-Tech Physical Exam"</b>

00:23:40.000 --> 00:23:42.970
<b>Terrible Luck</b>

00:23:40.000 --> 00:23:42.970
<b>Don't miss the next episode!</b>
